          "_name": "header11",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"header11\" group=\"Headers\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline name=\"imageWidth\" title=\"Image\" min=\"4\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Reverse\" name=\"reverseContent\" checked>\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background7.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-{{imageWidth}} image-wrapper\">\n                <img class=\"w-100\" src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/images202-569x539.jpg\" alt=\"Cognifort\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md\">\n                <div class=\"text-wrapper text-center\">\n                    <h1 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-1\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">\n                        <b>Make Fun Creating</b></h1>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Cognifort™ is a dietary supplement made for people who want to pay more attention to their cognitive wellness. Memory and concentration are important parts of everyday life, whether you are working, studying, reading, planning, or simply trying to stay organized. When your mind feels tired or distracted, even simple tasks can sometimes take more effort. Cognifort™ is designed to provide additional nutritional support for these everyday cognitive needs. It is not intended to replace medical treatment, and it should not be viewed as a cure for memory disorders or other health conditions. Instead, the idea behind the product is to make cognitive wellness part of a regular health routine.<br><br>One thing that stands out about Cognifort™ is its combination of several botanical ingredients rather than relying on only one ingredient. The formula includes Bacopa Monnieri, Lion’s Mane, Ginkgo Biloba, Rhodiola Rosea, and Panax Ginseng. These ingredients have different traditional uses and have also been studied in different areas of health and wellness. Some are commonly associated with memory and cognitive support, while others are often used in products focused on energy, resilience, or general wellness. Putting them together gives the formula a broader approach to supporting mental performance.<br><br>Cognifort™ may appeal to people who feel that their daily routine is becoming more mentally demanding. Someone working at a computer all day may need to concentrate for several hours without losing focus. A student may spend a long time reading and learning new information. Even people managing a household or running a business can have days when there are too many things to remember and too little time to handle them. Cognifort™ is intended to fit into these kinds of lifestyles by providing nutritional support for normal cognitive function.<br><br>At the same time, it is important to have realistic expectations from any supplement. Taking a capsule does not suddenly make someone smarter, and no supplement can replace proper sleep or a healthy diet. Your brain needs enough rest, nutrients, water, and regular physical activity to function properly. Stress can also affect how clearly you think and how well you concentrate. Cognifort™ can be used as an addition to these healthy habits, but it should not be considered a substitute for them.<br><br>Overall, Cognifort™ is best described as a daily cognitive wellness supplement. Its purpose is to support areas such as memory, focus, concentration, mental clarity, and general brain wellness through a blend of botanical ingredients. People respond differently to supplements, so the experience will not necessarily be the same for everyone. If you are experiencing sudden or ongoing problems with memory, concentration, or thinking, it is always better to speak with a qualified healthcare professional rather than relying only on a supplement.<br></p>\n                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Get Started</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
