          "_name": "content4",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content4\" group=\"Content\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video'&&bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"10\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"title col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\"><b>How GlucoFlush Works?\n</b><div><b><br></b></div></h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">The basic idea behind Cognifort™ is to provide a combination of botanical ingredients that may support different aspects of cognitive wellness. Instead of depending on a single ingredient, the formula brings together Bacopa Monnieri, Lion’s Mane, Ginkgo Biloba, Rhodiola Rosea, and Panax Ginseng. Each ingredient has a different background, which allows the formula to take a broader approach to areas such as memory, focus, mental clarity, energy, and resilience. The product is intended to complement a healthy lifestyle rather than work as a medical treatment.<div><br></div><div>Bacopa Monnieri is commonly used in cognitive-support formulas, particularly those focused on memory and learning. It has a long history in traditional wellness practices and has attracted research interest because of its potential connection with cognitive performance. In Cognifort™, Bacopa is included as part of the formula's memory-support approach. This does not mean that everyone who takes Bacopa will experience the same result. Botanical ingredients can work differently depending on the individual, the extract used, the amount provided, and how consistently the product is taken.</div><br><div>Lion’s Mane is another ingredient that has become popular among people interested in brain wellness. It is an edible mushroom that has been the subject of research involving the nervous system and cognitive health. In a formula like Cognifort™, Lion’s Mane is included to complement the other ingredients rather than act as a standalone solution. The goal is to support overall cognitive wellness and mental performance. It is still important to remember that research on an individual ingredient does not automatically prove that every finished supplement containing that ingredient will produce a particular result.</div><div><br></div><div>Ginkgo Biloba, Rhodiola Rosea, and Panax Ginseng add other dimensions to the formula. Ginkgo Biloba is traditionally associated with circulation and cognitive wellness. Rhodiola Rosea is commonly used in products focused on resilience and the body's response to demanding situations. Panax Ginseng has a long history of traditional use for energy and vitality. Together, these ingredients are intended to support a person's overall mental and physical routine. This broader approach makes sense because concentration is not completely separate from energy, stress, and general wellbeing.</div><br><div>The most realistic way to look at Cognifort™ is as nutritional support that may complement healthy cognitive habits. It is not something that should be expected to fix serious memory problems, eliminate stress, or replace adequate sleep. Getting enough rest, eating balanced meals, staying physically active, drinking enough water, and keeping the mind engaged are still important. If you decide to use Cognifort™, following the current product label and using it consistently is more sensible than taking more than recommended in an attempt to get faster results.</div></h4>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LIVE DEMO</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_anchor": "content4-2n",
          "_isUserblock": true,
          "_cid": "vawa0RkZCS",
